msgstr "$SPCXD is a tokenized representation of SpaceX distributed through Dinari's dShares™ infrastructure and the first tokenized U.S. equity available for spot trading on HyperCore. $SPCXD tokens on Hyperliquid are wrapped dShares™ and are restricted, meaning certain rights associated with the underlying security are frozen. If the wallet holding the dShares™ is KYC’ed with Dinari or a partner, those rights can be automatically restored with no additional effort by the tokenholder."

